    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 13 · 7:55</span>
      <strong>The empty picture frame on the back wall</strong>
      Above the cabinets on the back wall hangs an ornate wooden frame with a gold inner border and nothing inside it. This is not decoration: it is the receptacle. Open the inventory, select the finished painting and use it on the frame. The painting drops into the frame, and the frame — not the wall — is the door.
